          "answer": "1",
          "question_type": 1,
          "question": "设 $X_{1},X_{2},X_{3},X_{4}$ 是来自均值为0的指数分布总体的样本,其中0未知．设有估计量 $T_{1}=\\frac{1}{6}(X_{1}+X_{2})+\\frac{1}{3}(X_{3}+X_{4})$\n$T_{2}=\\frac{X_{1}+2X_{2}+3X_{3}+4X_{4}}{5},T_{3}=\\frac{X_{1}+X_{2}+X_{3}+X_{4}}{4}$,下列说法正确的是().",
          "analysis": "(1)\n$$\\begin{aligned}&\\theta=E(X),E(X_{i})=E(X)=\\theta,D(X)=\\theta^{2}=D(X_{i}),i=1,2,3,4\\\\&E(T_{1})=E\\bigg(\\frac{1}{6}(X_{1}+X_{2})+\\frac{1}{3}(X_{3}+X_{4})\\bigg)=\\bigg(\\frac{2}{6}+\\frac{2}{3}\\bigg)\\theta=\\theta,\\\\&E(T_{2})=\\frac{1}{5}E(X_{1}+2X_{2}+3X_{3}+4X_{4})=\\frac{1}{5}(1+2+3+4)\\theta=2\\theta,\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$\n$\\begin{array}{r}{E(T_{3})=\\frac{1}{4}E(X_{1}+X_{2}+X_{3}+X_{4})=\\theta,}\\end{array}$ 因此,T₁,T₃是θ的无偏估计量.\n(2) $\\begin{array}{r}{D(T_{1})=\\frac{2}{36}\\theta^{2}+\\frac{2}{9}\\theta^{2}=\\frac{10}{36}\\theta^{2},\\quad D(T_{3})=\\frac{1}{16}\\cdot4\\theta^{2}=\\frac{1}{4}\\theta^{2}=\\frac{9}{36}\\theta^{2},}\\end{array}$\n所以D(T₃)<D(T₁),作为θ的无偏估计量,T₃更为有效.",
