          "id": 401005,
          "subject_id": 3,
          "chapter_id": 401,
          "question_id": "pdf-ocr-401-005",
          "difficulty": "Hard",
          "answer": "1",
          "question_type": 1,
          "question": "设有k台仪器．已知用第i台仪器测量时,测定值总体的标准差为 $\\sigma_{i}(i=1,2,\\cdots,k)$ 用这些仪器独立地对某一物理量0各观\n察一次,分别得到 $X_{1},X_{2},\\cdots,X_{k}.$ 设仪器都没有系统误差,即 $E(X_{i})=\\theta(i=1,2,\\cdots,k)$ 若使 $\\begin{array}{r}{\\hat{\\pmb{\\theta}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}X_{i}}\\end{array}$ 估计θ时,\n是无偏的,并且 $D({\\hat{\\theta}})$ 最小,则 $a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{k}$ 应取的值是().",
          "analysis": "因为 $E(X_{i})=\\theta(i=1,2,\\cdots,k)$ 故 $\\begin{array}{r}{E(\\hat{\\theta})=E\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}X_{i}\\Big)=\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}E(X_{i})=\\theta\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i},}\\end{array}$ 欲使 $E({\\hat{\\pmb\\theta}})={\\pmb\\theta}$ 则要 $\\textstyle\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}=\\mathbf{1}$\n因此,当 $\\textstyle\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}=\\mathbf{1}$ 时, $\\begin{array}{r}{\\hat{\\pmb{\\theta}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}X_{i}}\\end{array}$ 为θ的无偏估计, $\\begin{array}{r}{D(\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}})=\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}^{2}\\sigma_{i}^{2}}\\end{array}$,要在 $\\textstyle\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}=\\mathbf{1}$ 的条件下 $D(\\hat{\\theta})$ 最小, 采用拉\n格朗日乘数法.\n$$\\begin{aligned}&1令 L(a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{k})=D(\\hat{\\theta})+\\lambda\\left(1-\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}\\right)=\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}^{2}\\sigma_{i}^{2}+\\lambda\\left(1-\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}\\right),\\\\ &\\begin{cases}\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial a_{i}}=0,i=1,2,\\cdots,k\\\\\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}=1,\\end{cases} 即 2a_{i}\\sigma_{i}^{2}-\\lambda=0,a_{i}=\\frac{\\lambda}{2\\sigma_{i}^{2}};\\\\ \\end{aligned}$$\n又因 $\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}=1$ 所以 $\\begin{array}{r}{\\lambda\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_{i}^{2}}=1,}\\end{array}$ 记 $\\textstyle\\sum_{i=1}^{k}{\\frac{1}{\\sigma_{i}^{2}}}={\\frac{1}{\\sigma_{0}^{2}}}$ 所以 $\\lambda=2\\sigma_{0}^{2}$ 于是 $\\begin{array}{r}{a_{i}=\\frac{\\sigma_{0}^{2}}{\\sigma_{i}^{2}}(i=1,2,\\cdots,k),}\\end{array}$ 故当\n$a_{i}=\\frac{\\sigma_{0}^{2}}{\\sigma_{i}^{2}}(i=1,2,\\cdots,k)$ 时, $\\begin{array}{r}{\\hat{\\pmb{\\theta}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{k}a_{i}X_{i}}\\end{array}$ 是0的无偏估计,且方差最小.",
